title: "QCR Workbench: A local-first quantitative cyber risk workbench"
authors:
  - family-names: Stone
    given-names: Scott Thomas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2718-6848"
year: 2026
version: "1.0"
type: software
url: "https://github.com/sstone55423/qcr-workbench"
keywords:
  - quantitative cyber risk
  - FAIR
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - risk management
  - local-first software
abstract: >-
  A local-first, privacy-preserving web workbench for FAIR-based quantitative
  cyber risk analysis: scenario scoping, modified-PERT calibration, Monte Carlo
  loss simulation, treatment economics, and executive reporting, with all data
  encrypted in the browser and optional bring-your-own-key or on-device AI
  assistance.
